>> think about on Astral besides whether someone's there who can cast
>> 'destroy armor'.
>
> I suspect so. That's why I don't want to worry about my armor. :)

You're missing the point, though.  By the time you hit the Planes and
Astral, whatever you've got will be what you're likely to have the rest
of the way.  I'd worry a lot more about destroy armor on the trip down
and trip up.  If you enter the Planes with fully-fixed armor (and DL1
might be an ideal spot to stop and do any repairs necessary), you're not
going to lose any of it unless you're outright careless.

